      "slug": "egusi",
      "term": "Egusi",
      "definition": "Dried and ground seeds of a West African gourd, related to watermelon. They have a nutty, slightly bitter flavour and thicken soups as they cook."
    },
    {
      "slug": "stockfish",
      "term": "Stockfish",
      "definition": "Air-dried cod used widely in Nigerian cooking for a deep umami flavour. Smoked mackerel is a practical substitute."
