  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The ground seeds called "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "egusi",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "egusi"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " give this soup its body and its name. Traditional recipes call for "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "stockfish",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "stockfish"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " alongside fresh meat, but smoked mackerel or prawns are good alternatives. Serve with fufu or rice."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ground egusi is sold in African grocery stores. If you buy whole seeds, grind them in a blender until they resemble coarse flour."
          }
        ]
      },
